# Private key, decrypted by anyone who has it — never committed (SOPS.md).
age.agekey
# Project-local, isolated kubeconfig — for demo purpose only (infra/demo/Makefile).
infra/demo/kubeconfig
# Ad-hoc TLS material from browser-trust/mkcert work (TLS.md) — certs, and
# especially private keys, never committed regardless of where they land.
*.crt
*.pem
*.key
# Ad-hoc debugging output (kubectl/flux/docker logs redirected to a file)
# — never meant to be committed, easy to forget mid-troubleshooting.
*.log